  "profile": {
    "storyTitle": "Profile",
    "text": "Akkord, real name Tonia Klang, is a tuner hailing from a remote Leithanian town. She was referred to Rhodes Island for treatment after contracting Oripathy in a soundfield core overload accident caused by a snowstorm. She currently helps out with Rhodes Island's music scene, while assisting in battle as a caster."
